              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Cymry89"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Was very good,but of course doesn't hold a whipped form due to the alcohol... So,I doubled the amount of bourbon and reduced it by about 1/2 to 2/3 in a small saucepan, allowed it to cool, then added that to the cream &amp; sugar and whipped. It worked! Had the bourbon taste &amp; my cream didn't fall.",
